    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1508570/extras/0639ce057d0569464b8cc5c70abf00e1.avif?t=1733273349\" /></div><br>It's your summer break right in the middle of summer heat.<br>You are alone in your apartment, bored with too much time in your hand.<br>Then, you received a phone call.<br>\u300cWe'll be going for a trip. Can you come over and look after Hazuki during the summer?\u300d<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1508570/extras/1875eadb5603cbd27a99e2fd5a95c8ec.avif?t=1733273349\" /></div><br><br>Your childhood friend Hazuki lives in a relaxing countryside surrounded by nature.<br>It's probably healthier for you to stay here rather than your apartment in the hot and humid city.<br>You hurry to prepare yourself for a trip to the countryside.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1508570/extras/100e393104a023434c023e7af77a6844.avif?t=1733273349\" /></div><br><br><br><br><strong>\uff5eCommunicate With Your Childhood Friend\uff5e</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1508570/extras/haduki_f_plain_normal.png?t=1733273349\" /></div><br><strong>Hazuki</strong><br>A quiet girl who is rather mature for her age.<br><br><br><br>She's also carefreely relaxing at home during her summer break.<br>Interact with her and build your friendship.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1508570/extras/e22a56f8e1179a3340dbfdf21ddc5681.avif?t=1733273349\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1508570/extras/f9e668f96117f46af672aeaf941ed812.avif?t=1733273349\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1508570/extras/fdbd6caf1dfbee94b81aa43a03751e4a.avif?t=1733273349\" /></div><br><br><br><br><strong>\uff5eYour childhood friend is becoming an adult\uff5e</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1508570/extras/e260b227f02b0326fe1013d404f81c7c.avif?t=1733273349\" /></div>",
